4e43d.600x338.jpg?t=1762468571"}],"short_description":"The year is 1923\u2014step inside Castle Woods Sanatorium, where care and cruelty blur together. Disguised as a doctor, you\u2019ll diagnose and treat patients using a deck of symptoms, tests, and outdated therapies. But tread carefully: one wrong move could expose you as an impostor.","steam_appid":2059090,"support_info":{"email":"support@zeitglas.com","url":"sanatoriumgame.com"},"supported_languages":"English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Italian, Russian","type":"game","website":"http://www.sanatoriumgame.com"}